    "App Store Connect runs one test at a time: a test that isn’t over (a draft included) refuses another until it ends or the draft is deleted. Atlas tests one placement at a time (header or searchResults) with one treatment against the live page; trafficProportion is the percent of visitors who see the treatment (1 to 100). The person creates the test from Review & Push; it stays a draft unless they send it to App Review. Atlas proposes deleting a draft only: a running test is stopped in App Store Connect (the API can’t).": {},
