    "Apple recognition": {},
    "Apple refused the app’s availability. If it was set up in App Store Connect meanwhile, discard this change, refresh Pricing and change countries and regions one at a time. A pre-order is only for an app that isn’t released yet, with a release date Apple accepts.": {},
    "Apple refused the app’s price. A paid price needs the Paid Applications agreement to be active in App Store Connect → Business (Free needs only the Free Apps agreement), and the key needs the Admin or App Manager role.": {},
