    "Apple reports by territory. A language adds up the territories whose App Store shows that page.": {},
    "Apple reviews it and may ask for documents in App Store Connect. No build is attached yet: link it there, or name its code in the Info.plist (ITSEncryptionExportComplianceCode) once it’s approved.": {},
    "Apple reviews it and may ask for documents in App Store Connect. The build is linked to it in the same push.": {},
    "Apple says %@’s game registration number for Vietnam is missing or not verified. Add it in App Store Connect.": {},
    "Apple says the ICP Filing Number it has for %@ isn’t valid. It needs a valid one for %@ to stay on the App Store in China mainland.": {},
    "Apple shows it to people who used to subscribe to %@ and are eligible.": {},
    "Apple shows one message from you on its Confirm Cancellation screen, on iOS and iPadOS 15.1, macOS 14 and visionOS 1 or later. The Cancel button always stays, and the message is marked as coming from you. Messages and offers go through App Review.": {},
