    "Check that %@'s In-App Events in Atlas will pass App Review. Read get_in_app_events with include [\"mediaDetails\"]: each draft's missingForReview, reviewWarnings and deepLinkCheck. Set what's missing with propose_event_details (deep link, purpose, priority, dates that have passed); check in this project that the app opens each deep link on its event and report it with report_deep_link_check; fix a text that breaks App Review's rules with propose_event_texts and revise true. %@": {},
