    "Draft a reply and tell me": {},
    "Draft a retention message for %@ in Atlas: what subscribers see on Apple's Confirm Cancellation screen after they tap Cancel Subscription. Read the app's project, its paywall and its App Store listing (get_listing) for what the subscription gives people, and get_retention for the subscriptions, the messages and offers there already, and the limits. Write it in the app's voice: a header of at most 66 characters and a message of at most 144, honest, no pressure, saying what people keep and what ends. %@ Propose it with propose_retention_message in the source language for the subscriptions it fits; Atlas translates it. If a discount would keep people, propose one retention offer with propose_retention_offer. Pass evidence as \"file:line — finding\".": {},
