    "In App Store Connect, open %@’s Product Page Optimization and create a test with one treatment named “%@”. On the treatment’s %@ tab, add “%@ – %@ – …” in each language. The “%@” images are what the page shows now, the control: leave them on the page.": {},
    "In App Store Connect, open **Users and Access → Integrations → App Store Connect API**.": {},
