    "In App Store Connect. Apple lets you replace it, not remove it.": {},
    "In Atlas, %@'s retention message \"%@\" runs over Apple's limits in %@ (%@): the header can have 66 characters and the message 144. Now: header \"%@\" (%lld), message \"%@\" (%lld). Write a shorter %@ version that says the same and reads naturally, and offer it with propose_retention_message for locale %@ with suggestion true (get_retention has the message's id); the person takes it with Use Shorter Version. %@": {},
    "In Atlas, for %@: %@\n\nRead what you need with Atlas's get_ and list_ tools and this project. Send any change as a proposal with the propose_ and suggest_ tools: the person reviews and pushes it. Don't push anything.": {},
