    "In-App Event deep link fix": {},
    "In-App Event texts follow Apple's In-App Events guidance (Guideline 2.3.13): no specific prices or discounts (App Review rejects them; whether the event needs a purchase is its purchase requirement), no claims that can't be verified such as “the best” or “#1”, no all capitals or repeated punctuation, no other platforms (2.3.10), no placeholder text (2.1) and “For Kids” only in the Kids Category (2.3.8). The name is the event's real name in title case, not a call to action or the event type; the descriptions are in sentence case and about the event, not the app in general. A text that breaks a rule is refused with the reason.": {},
