    "People can download %@ as soon as Apple has processed it. This can’t be undone.": {},
    "People can operate every control and enter text by speaking.": {},
    "People can order it now and download it on its release date. Only for an app that isn’t released yet; App Review approves it first.": {},
    "People decide right before they’re charged the full price for the first time. A message and an offer reach them when they tap Cancel Subscription.": {},
    "People delete version %@ more often than %@, and it doesn’t crash more.": {},
    "People never see the reference name. The badge shows on the event’s card, and the deep link opens the event in the app: it’s needed before you submit the event, and can be added later on the event’s page. Say it needs a purchase only when the event costs extra.": {},
    "People redeem an offer code to get %@ for free or at a lower price: in the App Store, in your app or by link.": {},
