    "Reply Automatically is on for %@ in Atlas. Read these new reviews with get_reviews (show: needsReply): %@. For each, write a reply in the reviewer’s own language, %@, specific to what they wrote, and send them with propose_review_replies, each with what it means in English. For every reply also send waitTopics, the ones the review is about from: %@ (empty when none), and unsure: true when you aren’t sure what the reviewer means. Read the project to say what is fixed or planned, and never promise what isn’t there.%@ %@ Never mention prices, offers, other apps or dates for new features, and never ask for a better rating. Atlas decides which replies go out by themselves from the person’s rule; you never send one, and you can’t change the rule.": {},
