    "Retention messages and offers": {},
    "Retention messages are for subscriptions. Create one in Prices first.": {},
    "Retention messages follow App Store Connect's content guidelines: no offers, discounts or prices such as “$9.99”, “50% off” or “one month free” (App Review rejects them: every subscriber sees the message), no unverifiable claims or statistics such as “the best app” or “92% of parents”, nothing coercive, no all capitals or repeated exclamation marks, no other platforms (2.3.10) and no placeholder text (2.1). What a subscriber loses by canceling is fine when it's factual, and so is announcing upcoming content. A text that breaks a rule is refused with the reason.": {},
