    "Subscribers and after download": {},
    "Subscribers who tap Cancel Subscription see only Apple’s Confirm Cancellation screen. A message reminds them what %@ gives them, and a retention offer can keep them at a lower price. Apple’s early results: about 1.4 more of every 100 stay with a message, 5.5 with an offer.": {},
